{
    "0": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's go!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Me too."
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I won!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "2": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So frustrating."
            ]
        }
    },
    "3": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey, Reimu!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I heard there's something strange going on!"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You'll know it when you see it!"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Animal spirits are seriously going on the offensive.",
                "I expected that, but..."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It must be the work of the",
                "beast world's outlaws!"
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Animal spirits?",
                "Offensive?"
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Did you get enough sleep?",
                "This isn't the time to joke around!"
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The problem is who owns this land!"
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "When those wealthy spirits just",
                "gave up the ownership of the land"
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "it was suddenly abandoned.",
                "It's a good chance, not a crisis!"
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I gotta get whatever I can before",
                "any greedy spirits show up and take over!"
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "......I see."
            ]
        },
        "130_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're on that side huh."
            ]
        },
        "138_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Marisa, you wake up!"
            ]
        },
        "146_0": {
            "lines": [
                "All the humans are losing their minds and sense of reason!",
                "They've given in to their primal instincts!"
            ]
        },
        "154_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're already a beast.",
                "I'll exorcise you!"
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The beast spirits are present even in the village..."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Those guys from the Animal Realm still",
                "haven't given up on conquering the surface, I see."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I have to hurry before things get out of control!"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, wow! Miss Reimu?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Even a komainu?",
                "What are you doing here?!"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "All those spirits are causing a ruckus!"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "My bestial blood is telling me to act!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "4": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Subduing beast spirits is <i$my> job."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Would you go back to the shrine, please?"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I can't think of anything but that."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Those beast world guys are always",
                "trying to rule the world."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Is that so? Well, best of luck to you."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I just have different thoughts, y'know."
            ]
        }
    },
    "5": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ahahaha!",
                "Guess I won!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Do you think looking all smart",
                "won't dull your powers?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "6": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How did you get here, komainu?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The spirits have been quite busy."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's the beasts' excitement!"
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There's an especially noisy",
                "commotion near the mountain..."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I should investigate around here."
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Gah! The shrine maiden!?",
                "I've stumbled into a real menace."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I better scram!"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why are you running away?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Up to no good, aren't you?!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "7": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It looks like this is more serious than I thought.",
                "Even a lowly mouse that's never seen the Animal Realm is involved."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Perhaps it isn't just beast spirits",
                "that are trying to invade..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "8": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The shrine maiden's onto me!",
                "I better hurry!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "9": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Th-the shrine maiden!?",
                "I ran into someone dangerous!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Gotta run!"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why are you running away?"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Up to no good, aren't you!?"
            ]
        },
        "100_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey, Reimu!"
            ]
        },
        "128_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The situation around here's gotten real dire."
            ]
        },
        "136_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm not blind, you know!"
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I expected an all-out attack from the beast spirits, but..."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It must be the work of those",
                "outlaws from the Animal Realm!"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Beast spirits?",
                "Attacking?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Are you half asleep?",
                "That sure isn't what's important!"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Land ownership is the actual problem here!"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There was land some rich spirits weren't",
                "ever going to give up."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Suddenly, they abandoned it.",
                "This is an opportunity, not a crisis!"
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's take some of it before",
                "the greedy spirits take over!"
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...I see."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're on <i$their> side, aren't you?"
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Open your eyes, Marisa!"
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If you've given up your human intellect and",
                "surrendered yourself to the law of the jungle..."
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...you're already a beast.",
                "I'll exorcise you!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "10": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You won, you won!",
                "I surrender!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Anyways, beast spirits? You think the ",
                "mastermind's from the Animal Realm, Reimu?"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I can't think of any other possibility."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Those guys in the Animal Realm were always",
                "trying to take over the world."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I see.",
                "Best of luck to you!"
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I have other ideas."
            ]
        }
    },
    "11": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Bye now!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I think you busied yourself too much with the thought",
                "that pure talent is enough instead of training."
            ]
        }
    },
    "12": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What is a moon rabbit doing here?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, well, come on."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I decided to take over the Earth?",
                "Now's the best chance."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's an impressive thing to try."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But dying is better!"
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I thought this was the road to the Animal Realm.",
                "Is this the right way?"
            ]
        },
        "136_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey, where do you think you're going?"
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh? Suika?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You said you're heading to Hell?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're as sharp as ever.",
                "I'm impressed."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But where did you notice it?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That the one who set the beast spirits",
                "after the surface was in Hell, I mean."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Uh, no, I...",
                "I'm going to the Animal R..."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The masters of those beast spirits are",
                "in the Animal Realm, right?"
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...oh, bother. That's not right."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No more business with you then.",
                "Turn back! And quick!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "13": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What the... Suika, you..."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Still as strong as ever."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Very well.",
                "I'll tell you."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If you wanna deal with this faster,",
                "don't go to the Animal Realm."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huuuh?"
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let me welcome you...",
                "...in Hell!"
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And ruin the culprit's plan!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "14": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're getting rusty.",
                "If you go further, you're just going to die."
            ]
        }
    },
    "15": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Aah, this storm feels familiar..."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Feels exactly like Hell."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, well, well.",
                "Welcome to Hell."
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're that famous shrine maiden from Gensokyo, right?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who are you?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "My name's Hisami Yomotsu,",
                "The guide of Hell."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No matter who, no matter when,",
                "all are welcome in Hell."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "=Now, where would you like to go today?"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I... I'm here to stop the beast spirit invasion."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I heard something about a mastermind residing in Hell."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...just a few moments ago."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ohoho!",
                "How did you come to realize that?"
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The feast hasn't even started yet."
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Still, I'll show you the way."
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And in keeping the spirit of Hell",
                "I'm going to make you a spirit of Hell!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "16": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Aah!",
                "Fantastic!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I haven't encountered a human so strong in years."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There's only one other person I can think of."
                "Her Greatness."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Her Greatness?"
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No need to hurry,",
                "Now, I'll show you the way."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You've been wanting to meet Her Greatness",
                "from the beginning, weren't you?"
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Uh, no, I mean, yeah..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "17": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Then I will guide you, as promised."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "To Hell, of course."
            ]
        },
        "46_0": {
            "lines": [
                "w@VSEND()"
            ]
        }
    },
    "18": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "... I've fallen into Hell."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Just by going with the flow."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You. Living human."
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You stand before Zanmu Nippaku."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What sort of matter brought you to this world of nothingness?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You are the one who's controlling the beast spirits",
                "to take over the surface, right?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I, Reimu Hakurei, am here to exterminate you!"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Me, controlling beast spirits...",
                "Taking over the surface...?"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Heh-heh-heh."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I haven't committed anything of the sort <i$yet>."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Nor do I ever intend to."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Have you come before me to solve an incident ",
                "that has <b$not yet even occurred>?"
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What on earth are you talking about...?"
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Don't try to fool me.",
                "It's just my hunch, but you seem like you'd do something like that."
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah-hah-hah!"
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You, who have met neither the crazed beast dancing on the mountain,",
                "nor the vigorous beast waiting in the forest,"
            ]
        },
        "248_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Nor even the blood-loving beast that drinks from ",
                "the depth of the earth, came straight to me."
            ]
        },
        "256_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How can one not laugh about this?"
            ]
        },
        "264_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I like you.",
                "I'll fight you as you wished, of course."
            ]
        },
        "272_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You'll remain bewildered by witnessing how this incident resolves",
                "before you understand why."
            ]
        },
        "280_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Your efforts deserve a suitable reward!",
                "Feel the bane of nothingness!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "20": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was a fool to expect anything from <i$you>."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "For a moment, you reminded me of my old self."
            ]
        }
    }
}